## Hard rules

- Strict types and the full gate set from day one; ratchets only shrink.
- Authorization on every state-changing route, proven by a test on that route.
- i18n keys only{{#if ui}} (including `aria-label`, `title`, `alt`, `sr-only`){{/if}}; locales: {{LOCALES}}.
{{#if multiTenant}}
- Tenant-scope every query: application scope plus database row-level security, both tested.
{{/if}}
- Log every state change in the append-only audit log as `{key, params}`.
- One fact, one derivation: import it, never restate it.

High-risk paths (two reviewers{{#if ownerReviewsHigh}} and owner review{{/if}}): {{RISK_HIGH}}.

